{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-9fe439", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261025-c90813"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-3c2964"}, "note": "空欄を埋めない行為を、空白への反復的な認証が新たな価値と義務を作る場面へ置き直す。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-802c4a", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-3c2964"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261102-62a1dd"}, "note": "先行する声が次の一歩を可能にする対話に対し、先行する印が次の者の不参加を難しくする場面を置く。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-b218e1", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261025-f042e6"}, "relation_type": "reframes", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-3c2964"}, "note": "戻ることを要求する日課を、空箱の開封連続記録として具体化する。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-2100bb", "left": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261027-a8c097"}, "relation_type": "metaphorically_resonates", "right": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-3c2964"}, "note": "本体より箱上の文字が格を作るという要約が、空の内箱より蓋裏が重くなる構図へ響く。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-d24e3a", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-3c2964"}, "relation_type": "responds_to", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-20261027-5c8d51"}, "note": "出自の空白へ欄を増やす応答が、記録行為そのものの強制を生みうる場合を描く。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
{"relation_id": "REL-20261027-a14acc", "left": {"type": "fragment", "id": "FRAG-20261027-3c2964"}, "relation_type": "contrast", "right": {"type": "material", "id": "MAT-LIT-20261025-c015b6"}, "note": "紛らすものなく一人であることの肯定に、空白を放置できず日課で埋める振る舞いを対置する。", "created_at": "2026-10-27"}
